    - Term: GameOverDescription
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "Tu cuerpo seguir\xE1 existiendo, pero... ya no ser\xE1s t\xFA."
      - Your body will still exist, but... you will no longer be you.
      Flags: 0000
      Languages_Touch: []
    - Term: Win
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - "\xA1LO CONSEGUISTE!"
      - YOU DID IT!
      Flags: 0000
